A||||6||Adrift||Horns not connected at all - how to reconnect?||||1||
Z||000000||Adrift||11-12-2001||03:58 PM||||The horns on my car are not connected electrically to my car at all - they're just bolted on, no wires comming out of them. The horns are rusted to hell too. So I just replaced the horns with new monza ones, and attached new wires, but looking in the Haynes manual I can't find  where the wire to the horn is / what color it is / where it comes from. I could just drill a hole and feed them directly to the relay, which color wire on the horn relay is for hooking up the horns? Thanks<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||Adrift||11-12-2001||05:45 PM||||bump||||reg||1
Z||000002||StuGood||11-12-2001||06:05 PM||||Wire to horn is dark green.  Should be found in the fender(s), near where the horn(s) was. Single pin (spade) connector.<P>FWIW, the wires to the horn relay are: orange (always +12v), black (ground this to actuate the relay), and dark green (output to horn(s)).||||reg||1
Z||000003||Adrift||11-12-2001||08:17 PM||||No wires found around where the horn was - can I just splice into the dark green wire at the relay?||||reg||1
Z||000004||Adrift||11-13-2001||12:13 AM||||bump||||reg||1
Z||000005||Formula88||11-13-2001||08:50 AM||||An educated guess would be yes.  The dark green coming from the relay should go straight to the horn.  ||||reg||6
Z||000006||theogre||11-13-2001||12:29 PM||||You don't need to drill or wire all the way to the dash...<P>Open the hood and look by the left headlight.<P>There should be a hole there with wires going thru it into the fender. Pre 87 I think only the marker light and horn go out the hole. 87&+ the wires for the headlight motor controls go out there too. You should be able to easily pick up the correct wire in the bundle there. Same on the other side if the car came with 2 horns.<P>Even when it's all there, the wire can be hard to see unless you get under there with a flashlight. You should be able to at least find the stub of the old wire up in there.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||1
